@startuml
title Activites Du Compte - Notification (In-App + Email Critique)

actor User
participant "UI (Profil / Login&Security)" as UI
participant "Service metier\n(profile/security/oauth/phone)" as DomainService
participant "AccountActivityDispatcher" as Dispatcher
participant "Policy Service" as Policy
participant "Notifications DB" as NotificationDB
participant "Email Service" as Email
participant "Logger" as Logger

User -> UI : Effectue une action compte
UI -> DomainService : submit(action)
DomainService -> DomainService : execute action principale
DomainService --> UI : succes action principale

DomainService -> Dispatcher : emitAccountActivityEvent(event)
Dispatcher -> Policy : resolveChannels(event, userPreferences)
Policy --> Dispatcher : channels + criticality

alt Channel in-app autorise
  Dispatcher -> NotificationDB : createNotification(...)
  NotificationDB --> Dispatcher : ok
else in-app non autorise
  Dispatcher -> Logger : info("in-app skipped by policy")
end

alt Channel email requis
  Dispatcher -> Email : sendAccountActivityEmail(...)
  Email --> Dispatcher : ok
else email non requis
  Dispatcher -> Logger : info("email skipped by policy")
end

Dispatcher -> Logger : info("account activity dispatched")

note over Dispatcher,Policy
Regle metier:
- Evenements critiques securite => envoi force
- Evenements non critiques => respect isAccountActivity
- Echec de dispatch = non bloquant pour action principale
end note

@enduml

